{"id":6322,"chapter_id":6,"scene_id":611,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"它突然化成无数黑泥掐住卓娅的脖子。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"混沌的声音","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><size=44>留下！！</size></color>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"你到底是谁！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"黑泥之上，溶解凝聚出一个身影。那竟是卓娅自己。","style":3,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"卓娅？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你所有的战斗、所有的力量、所有的渴望、都是我……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"卓娅？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你的灵魂深处联系的是我……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"你……？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"青年卓娅？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>我就是你，自你而生，我是你的愿望。</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222008"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"青年卓娅？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你为破坏而生。</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"幼年卓娅？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你……只属于这里！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"闭嘴！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":602,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"在她背后升起赤红的幻月。那是一只巨大的眼睛、猩红的凝视，牢牢攫住她灵魂深处，攫住她所有的过往、憎恨和渴望。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"她看到了手上沾的血，看清自己犯下的罪。她理解了一切，力量，黑环，根源……这是自她诞生的深渊，这一次，敌人是不可战胜的……她自己。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"混沌的声音","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>就是这样……战斗吧，卓娅……永远战斗，永远破坏……</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222013"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"永远破坏……","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"可这……是我的战斗吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_6222015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_06","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"隐约中，她听到熟悉的轰鸣声，一团团爆炸化为渺小的火球，不断靠近那轮红月，慢慢地也被吞噬了。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}